      "visualSettings": "{\"title\":{\"fontSize\":14},\"general\":{\"type\":\"pie\",\"displayType\":\"default\",\"fillOpacity\":1,\"startAngle\":270,\"innerRadius\":\"30%\",\"maxNumOfSlices\":\"10\",\"mode\":\"distribution\"},\"color\":{\"family\":\"Categorical Default\"},\"axes\":{\"axisX\":{\"titleFontSize\":12,\"labelFontSize\":12},\"axisY\":{\"titleFontSize\":12,\"labelFontSize\":12}},\"legend\":{\"enabled\":false,\"wrap\":true,\"verticalAlign\":\"right\",\"showAsTable\":true},\"series\":{}}",
